ent-WFMaterialHide = animal hide
    .desc = A raw hide off a farm animal. Tanners and traders take it.

ent-WFMobLivestockAsclepiu = ridgeback goat
    .desc = A sure-footed goat of Asclepiu's hills, with a crest of coarse hair down its back. Feed it by hand and it might follow you home.
ent-WFMobLivestockVerda = meadow ox
    .desc = A placid ox that grazes Verda's meadows in small herds. Patient people have milked them for generations.
ent-WFMobLivestockMerak = dune fowl
    .desc = A long-legged desert bird that lays big, thick-shelled eggs in the sand.
ent-WFMobLivestockThrascias = musk goat
    .desc = A shaggy goat that shrugs off Thrascias's cold. Its wool is the warmest there is.
ent-WFMobLivestockFervidus = ash hen
    .desc = A soot-grey hen that scratches through the hot ash for grubs, and lays eggs too hot to hold.
ent-WFMobLivestockAerumna = spore cow
    .desc = A slow, violet-hided cow from Aerumna's fungal forest. Its milk tastes faintly of mushrooms.
ent-WFMobLivestockCarcinoma = flesh hen
    .desc = Something like a hen, grown out of Carcinoma's flesh. It lays eggs, and that is all anyone wants to know.
